---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Disclaimer — ExpertNetworks.net"
  description="Legal disclaimer for ExpertNetworks.net. This site provides general information about expert networks and does not constitute professional advice or endorsement."
  canonicalPath="/disclaimer"
  jsonLd={{
    '@context': 'https://schema.org',
    '@type': 'BreadcrumbList',
    'itemListElement': [
      { '@type': 'ListItem', 'position': 1, 'name': 'Home', 'item': 'https://expertnetworks.net/' },
      { '@type': 'ListItem', 'position': 2, 'name': 'Disclaimer' }
    ]
  }}
>
  <section class="pt-[calc(var(--nav-h)+3.5rem)] pb-section px-4 sm:px-6">
    <div class="max-w-[680px] mx-auto">
      <a href="/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 min-h-[44px] text-accent-text text-sm font-medium no-underline mb-4 hover:underline">
        &larr; Home
      </a>

      <p class="eyebrow mb-3">Legal</p>
      <h1 class="text-step-4 font-bold tracking-[-0.03em] text-primary mb-4">Disclaimer</h1>

      <div class="editorial">
        <h2>General Information</h2>
        <p>ExpertNetworks.net is an independent information resource. The content on this site is provided for general informational purposes only and does not constitute professional advice, endorsement, or recommendation of any expert network, service, or provider.</p>

        <h2>Accuracy of Information</h2>
        <p>We make reasonable efforts to ensure the information presented is accurate and up to date. However, expert network companies frequently update their offerings, pricing, expert counts, and capabilities. Data points such as expert counts and employee numbers are approximate and may reflect publicly reported figures that have since changed. We note the "last updated" date on each profile for transparency.</p>
        <p>If you represent an expert network and believe any information is inaccurate, please contact us at <a href="mailto:hollow.baton-0p@icloud.com">hollow.baton-0p@icloud.com</a> and we will review and correct it promptly. See our <a href="/sources">Sources &amp; Methodology</a> and <a href="/verification">Verification Framework</a> for how we ensure accuracy.</p>

        <h2>No Affiliation</h2>
        <p>ExpertNetworks.net is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or commercially tied to any expert network company listed on this site. We do not receive compensation, referral fees, or any form of payment from the networks we profile.</p>

        <h2>No Investment or Legal Advice</h2>
        <p>Nothing on this site constitutes investment advice, legal advice, or a recommendation to engage any particular expert network. Users should conduct their own due diligence and consult appropriate professionals before making purchasing or investment decisions.</p>

        <h2>Third-Party Links</h2>
        <p>This site contains links to external websites operated by the expert networks themselves and by third-party news sources. We are not responsible for the content, accuracy, or privacy practices of these external sites.</p>

        <h2>Trademarks</h2>
        <p>All company names, logos, and trademarks mentioned on this site are the property of their respective owners. Use of these names does not imply endorsement by or affiliation with ExpertNetworks.net.</p>

        <p class="meta !mt-10 pt-6 border-t border-border/60">Last updated: March 2026</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
